# Purpose

Haptics are an invisible layer of communication.

Users should rarely notice haptic feedback consciously.

Instead they should feel confidence.

A haptic should reinforce an interaction.

Never replace visual feedback.

Never become repetitive.

---

# Philosophy

Aura should feel physical.

Buttons should feel pressable.

Cards should feel tangible.

Scenes should feel powerful.

Errors should feel unmistakable.

Every vibration has meaning.

---

