# Background Events

Automatic updates

No haptic.

Device reconnect

No haptic.

Background sync

No haptic.

Only user initiated actions deserve feedback.

---

# Accessibility

Users may disable haptics.

Aura must continue functioning perfectly.

Reduce Motion does not disable haptics.

Separate settings should exist.

---

# Performance

Haptic feedback begins within

30 milliseconds

after user interaction.

Never wait for network responses before triggering touch feedback.

---

# Anti Patterns

Never vibrate continuously.

Never stack multiple haptics.

Never vibrate during scrolling.

Never vibrate every tap.

Never use heavy impact for normal actions.

Never celebrate routine interactions.

